---
import BaseLayout from "~/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "~/data/site";

const updated = "August 2026";
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Terms of use for this website.">
  <section class="container-prose pt-16 pb-8 md:pt-24">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-ruled">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="display-l mt-7">Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-[14px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">Last updated {updated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-prose pb-24">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        This site is operated by {site.legal.legalEntity}, based in
        {site.location}. By using it you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>
        The text, design and images on this site are mine unless stated otherwise,
        and are protected by copyright. You're welcome to quote from the journal
        with attribution and a link. Please don't reproduce whole pieces without
        asking first.
      </p>
      <p>
        Client and institution names appear as a factual record of work done. Their
        trademarks belong to them, and their appearance here is not an endorsement
        of this site by them.
      </p>

      <h2>No advice</h2>
      <p>
        Everything published here is general commentary on organisational learning
        and leadership development. It is not professional advice for your specific
        situation, and it shouldn't be relied on as though it were. For that, get in
        touch and we'll talk about your actual context.
      </p>

      <h2>Esoterica</h2>
      <p>
        Readings offered under Esoterica are provided as a reflective practice for
        personal insight. They are not a prediction of future events, and they are
        not a substitute for professional medical, psychological, legal or financial
        advice. Decisions you take remain your own.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        I try to keep the site accurate and available, but I don't guarantee that it
        will be uninterrupted or error-free, and details of services may change.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
